{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Make the step-body canary replay-visible**\n\nThe context remains in replay mode here because `_replay_aware()` sees the checkpointed `WAIT`, so `StepContext.logger` suppresses this INFO call. If validation regresses to execute the step body and reject the mismatch afterward, the case can still pass without exposing that side effect. Cast/rebind the concrete logger with `with_is_replaying(lambda: False)` before emitting this canary so any body execution is observable.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7pAUPe","finding_digest":"82bcda4537c37c562b6d8c5a2bdd00043e92577b9a4a2588bc5c37d289ef6fd6","finding_id":"arf_v1_qk6nurjxyn6fmk3nrrncxxiaaq","finding_key":"conformance/replay_operation_identity.py::unexpected_step::replay-visible-body-canary","identity_key":"conformance/replay_operation_identity.py::unexpected_step::replay-visible-body-canary","line":15,"observation_digest":"fb340e03bca4a8d78ca74e7e3127436e06c57cd322eedb150876cbb87d1b3a97","observation_id":"aro_v1_7m2a4a54usunpdfhjz7dcj2dny","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-conformance-tests/handlers/general/replay_operation_identity.py","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-01T23:02:44Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2jy2v4dwujjh4fnsvew6qhvv6o","reviewed_base_sha":"0325f6a0083ed9c0d80aaa38279aa9311b77c0e2","reviewed_head_sha":"69f233947df69b731f0f9e43eec2e6bab7fac61f","reviewer":"codex","start_line":15,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":701},"record_id":"art_v1_6foydlrnp4dytz7qjihm4n2mgv","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-01T23:02:44Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
